    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Werewulf is a 3D third person adult survival horror game with a female protagonist. Story driven linear gameplay with semi-open world elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroine has been kidnapped and imprisoned in a cruel station far away from civilization, stalked by a werewolf bringing hell with him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can she escape this nightmare station? Will she be able to discover why the werewolf is hunting her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >List of features:<br><br>The game contains <strong>31 story mission levels</strong>, <strong>10 safe zone levels</strong>, and <strong>6 challenge levels</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storyline with dark and claustrophobic atmoshpere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voiced, cinematic cutscenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interaction with friendly and hostile NPC's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging but fair gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High quality graphics and sex animations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out why you were kidnapped: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343900/extras/cryo.gif?t=1754896380\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the station, complete missions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343900/extras/861f32a086ebd757d23cfe320f8b1ab2.poster.avif?t=1754896380\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2343900/extras/861f32a086ebd757d23cfe